  "body": "Source: review of PR #2503 (merged, 2f965f7d9), comment 6978269279.\n\nOwed items:\n- MCP `generate` and `verify` now return a `notes` array for each operation that has notes. The `camcraft-mcp` skill does not list it. Document the field.\n- `generate.rs` (about 3860 lines) is over the 400-line limit. Split it along the domain seam.\n- `script/api.rs` (439 lines) is over the 400-line limit. Split it along the domain seam.\n- The new stock-outline selection can move into `keep_law.rs`. Decide if it moves, and record the decision.\n- The module comment of `unreached.rs` describes only the band check of #1655. It does not describe the new corner check. Update the comment.\n\nDone means: each item is done, or has a recorded decision in `docs/decisions/`.\n",
